    "text": "with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\n\nprocedure Main is -- implicitly called by the environment task\n   subtype A_To_Z is Character range 'A' .. 'Z';\n\n   task My_Task;\n\n   task body My_Task is\n   begin\n      for I in A_To_Z'Range loop\n         Put (I);\n      end loop;\n      New_Line;\n   end My_Task;\nbegin\n   for I in A_To_Z'Range loop\n      Put (I);\n   end loop;\n   New_Line;\nend Main;\n",
